WEBVTT

00:42:56.079 --> 00:43:00.746
hopefully we do try to say, like, this is
really serious. This is a big deal.

00:43:00.746 --> 00:43:02.246
This is going to affect all of us.

00:43:02.246 --> 00:43:04.746
We need to have a big conversation
about what to do with it.

00:43:06.288 --> 00:43:07.954
Help me understand the structure
a bit better,

00:43:08.454 --> 00:43:12.871
because you definitely surprised much
people when you announced that Microsoft

00:43:12.871 --> 00:43:19.579
were putting a billion dollars into
the organization and in return,

00:43:20.038 --> 00:43:23.163
I guess they get certain exclusive
licensing rights.

00:43:23.163 --> 00:43:28.913
And so, for example, they are the
exclusive licensee of CP3.

00:43:29.288 --> 00:43:32.163
So talk about that structure
of how you win.